Package: causalML
Type: Package
Title: Causal Machine Learning Methods
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Abu Sufiun",
        "Rhyme",
        email = "asrhyme@isrt.ac.bd",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    Provides functions for causal machine learning, including
    causal additive forests, causal boosting, causal BART,
    causal forests, causal MARS, model comparison, causal
    prediction, parametric standardization, and causal data
    simulation. The package is designed for estimating
    heterogeneous treatment effects, including conditional
    average treatment effects (CATE) and average treatment
    effects (ATE), and for evaluating causal machine learning
    methods through simulation studies.
